<title>UK: Tinsley Robor plans 11.4 mln stg Dutch buy.</title>
<headline>Tinsley Robor plans 11.4 mln stg Dutch buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tinsley Robor Plc, a supplier of packaging to the music and multimedia publishing industries, said on Friday one of its subsidiaries had conditionally agreed to buy Lenteweg BV for an initial 11.4 million stg.</p>
<p>The group said the purchase of Netherlands-based Lenteweg, a supplier of specialist printed packaging, would be financed with borrowings from committed bank facilities.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
